<title>BOSNIA: FEATURE-Moslems want voting on Serb territory invalidated.</title>
<headline>FEATURE-Moslems want voting on Serb territory invalidated.</headline>
<byline>Mark Heinrich</byline>
<dateline>SARAJEVO 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bosnia's Moslem-led central government has urged the Organisation for Security and Cooperation in Europe to invalidate the results of elections on Serb-controlled territory even before they are held.</p>
</text>
